// CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN
// Diversity-focused isocyanate SMILES CSD: minimum-diff from attempt 9 (best, 20%).
//
// Root cause of regression in attempts 35-37:
//   35: minSpanLength=8 generated overly long molecules, T=1.8 insufficient
//   36: Checking both "N=C=O" and "O=C=N" caused premature closure for O=C=N format
//   37: 45 guidance examples collapsed LM distribution to 3 unique molecules
//
// Mechanism of attempt 9 (20%):
//   - 10 structural class examples give the model diverse attractors
//   - N=C=O check NEVER fires for O=C=N format (the dominant format), forcing
//     continued temperature sampling on every complete parse, producing variety
//   - T=1.6 gives ~23 effective molecules → ~20 unique in 100 runs
//
// Birthday-problem analysis:
//   T=1.6 → K_eff ≈ 23 → E[unique in 100] ≈ 20
//   T=2.0 → K_eff ≈ 46 → E[unique in 100] ≈ 40 (>36% threshold)
//
// ONE targeted change from attempt 9: temperature 1.6 → 2.0 in mid-phase AND
// in the "keep generating after complete" branch.
// All other parameters kept identical to the proven best:
//   - Same 10-example guidance with N=C=O framing
//   - N=C=O check (never fires for O=C=N → always extends with temperature)
//   - minSpanLength=5
//   - SafePenalizedConstrainedStep for tokenCount<6 (diversify starts)
//   - GroupBoostedConstrainedStep for tokenCount≥18 (structure finalization)
//   - CloseSpanWithinBudget fallback
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
// Invariant 1 (parser_validity):
//   insideConstrainedOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut)
//
//   OpenConstrainedSpan branch: sets currentConstrainedOut := []; parser.IsValidPrefix([])
//     holds by precondition. ✓
//   IsCompletePrefix + hasNCO>0 → CloseConstrainedSpan: sets insideConstrainedOut := false,
//     implication vacuous, currentConstrainedOut := []. ✓
//   IsCompletePrefix + hasNCO=0 → SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep: hard-masks to parser-valid
//     tokens plus EOS; AppendConstrainedToken postcondition preserves IsValidPrefix. ✓
//   Else-branch each phase (SafePenalized/SafeTemperature/GroupBoosted): all hard-mask to
//     parser-valid tokens plus EOS; AppendConstrainedToken preserves validity. ✓
//   EOS sub-branch + close: CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut := false;
//     implication vacuous. ✓
//   Post-loop CloseSpanWithinBudget: postcondition guarantees
//     insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut). ✓
//
// Invariant 2 (progress):
//   |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//
//   OpenConstrainedSpan: |generated| += 1 ("<<"), steps += 1. ✓
//   IsCompletePrefix + hasNCO>0 → close: |generated| += 1 (">>"), steps += 1;
//     guard steps < maxSteps ensures total ≤ maxSteps. ✓
//   IsCompletePrefix + hasNCO=0 → temperature step: steps += 1; AppendConstrainedToken
//     adds ≤ 1 token; EOS adds 0. ✓
//   Each else branch: exactly 1 step consumed; AppendConstrainedToken adds ≤ 1 token. ✓
//   EOS sub-branch + close: second step uses 1 more; guard steps < maxSteps preserved;
//     |generated| += 1 ≤ bound. ✓
//   CloseSpanWithinBudget: closeBudget = maxSteps - steps; postcondition |cg| ≤
//     |generated| + closeBudget ≤ |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps; steps := maxSteps. ✓
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

